Third-party material
====================

Nothing from other projects is copied into this repository. The libraries
Objectspace uses are linked dynamically and come from the system (Fedora's
packages): cairo, fontconfig, FreeType, HarfBuzz, libdrm, libpipewire,
librsvg, libsndfile, libsystemd, libvterm, libxkbcommon, Linux-PAM, pixman,
SQLite, Wayland, wlroots, xcb and zlib, each under its own licence.

At build time, wayland-scanner turns protocol descriptions from the system's
wayland-protocols package into C files (build/g0/*-protocol.c), which are
compiled into the programs named below. Their copyright and permission
notices, as the protocol files carry them:

